======================================================================
MUTATION B2 -- a baked base PLUS an unrelated location.port comparison
======================================================================

Claim under test (the static heuristic's BOUND):
  PASS  the shipped bundle carries a comparison of the page location port

The base is baked AND the bundle carries a location.port comparison that
does not select the base. The static heuristic CANNOT tell this from
the honest bundle -- it only sees that a comparison exists -- so this
shape leaves the static heuristic GREEN. That is the honest bound of
the heuristic, and it is why the runtime-resolution claim is proved by
the EXECUTED discriminator in ui-smoke.mjs, which opens the page by
NAME (localhost) and records the host the API requests actually went
to. A baked base sends them to the numeric address; a runtime-resolved
base sends them to localhost.

--- mutation: apps/studio/lib/api.ts (baked base + unrelated comparison) ---
  before: (the runtime base definition in apps/studio/lib/api.ts)
  after : the base is a constant; a location.port comparison remains, but
          it only feeds a diagnostic string -- it no longer selects the base

